  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project with the Catholic Franciscan Sisters religious order will support the running costs of the Kidane Meheret children&#x2019;s home in Addis Ababa over a six month period. The grant will cover the food costs of approx. 100 children, 15 of whom have mild to severe physical and mental disabilities, who are cared for in the home.  The home cares for children of all ages whom are provided with accomodation, food clothing, education and health care.</narrative>
  </description>
